# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supertherm site + CMS environment
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. Only PUBLIC_* vars reach the browser/build.
# The site builds fine WITHOUT these (falls back to static content).
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# Supabase project (from Project Settings → API)
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key

# Contact form: the "Send enquiry" button composes a WhatsApp message to the
# company number (company.phone in src/data/site.ts) — no extra config needed.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# The following are NOT used by the site build — they are set as
# Supabase Edge Function secrets (never exposed to the browser):
#
#   supabase secrets set ADMIN_PASSCODE="choose-a-strong-passcode"
#   supabase secrets set CF_DEPLOY_HOOK="https://api.cloudflare.com/.../deploy_hooks/..."
#
# (SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY are provided to the
#  function automatically by Supabase.)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
